WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.102 --> 00:00:04.652
Some functions do something. Others give an answer back, with return.

2
00:00:05.479 --> 00:00:10.404
metres of 5 works out five times twenty, and gives back one hundred.

3
00:00:11.356 --> 00:00:15.031
The inner call runs first, so forward gets one hundred.

4
00:00:19.332 --> 00:00:23.682
print only shows a value on screen. The program cannot use it.
